The validation artifacts are ready: LLVM smoke assertions pass, the independent brute-force oracle checked 137,256 arrays with zero mismatches, the false-result probe was rejected with actual result `5`, and the body mutation was rejected with actual result `-3`. I’ve assembled these into `prove.sh` and am running that exact end-to-end script once as the final reproducibility check.
