+### `SPEC.loop-invariant`
+
+- **Class:** Derived reachability lemma/circularity.
+- **Semantic role:** Executes and summarizes the real source loop; it is not an
+  ordinary rewrite in `verification.k`.
+- **Domain:** `allInts(VS)`, with module binding guard
